Z||000013||filthyscarecrow||04-06-2001||02:25 AM||||just set it up like a CART engine-<BR>"flat" crank that fires 2 cyl every 240* of crankshaft rotation. (it should be 180* hence the name flat crank, but V-6 has fewer cyl than a V-8). this would be really expensive and complicated though so i'll just shut up. i think it would be interesting to try though... hell, it probably wouldn't even work on a V-6, but an aurora V-8 would sound REEAL nice hehe...<P>------------------<BR>allow me to show you my exhaust pipes...<p>[This message has been edited by filthyscarecrow (edited 04-06-2001).]||||reg||1
